This project includes third-party components:

1. DeepCW model and decoding pipeline
   - models/deepcw-narrow.onnx is model_narrow.onnx from deepcw-engine.
   - ai-decoder-core.js adapts the spectrogram, normalization, posterior
     stitching and CTC decoding from deepcw-engine examples/nodejs/decode_morse.mjs.
   - ai-decoder-core.js (tone finder) and waterfall.js (colour map, column
     rendering) adapt ideas from web-deep-cw-decoder.
   Source: https://github.com/e04/deepcw-engine
           https://github.com/e04/web-deep-cw-decoder

